---
import { skills } from '../../data/skills';
---

<section id="about">
  <h2>About</h2>
  <p>
    I build the systems behind the screen: backend services, data pipelines and IoT infrastructure.
    I care about clean architecture, honest engineering and software that holds up in production. My
    rule of thumb: simple until proven otherwise.
  </p>
  <p>
    Since 2023, I have been a backend engineer at STARI (ULB &amp; FARI) in Brussels, working
    closely with FARI, the AI Institute for the Common Good. I reach for Rust when correctness and
    performance are critical, and TypeScript when iteration speed matters more.
  </p>
  <p>
    With the FARI AI Academy, I delivered a one-day training session on AI for the common good for
    BELSPO, the Belgian Federal Science Policy Office.
  </p>

  <h3>Stack</h3>
  <ul>
    {skills.map((category) => (
      <li>
        <strong>{category.label}</strong>: {category.items.join(', ')}
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>
</section>
